                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="677 1907 677 1924 2451 1913 2453 1896 2447 1866 2230 1866 2206 1855 2204 1855 2202 1855 2200 1855 2198 1855 2180 1866 2070 1857 2068 1857 2005 1868 1970 1857 1968 1857 1966 1857 1914 1868 1845 1857 1842 1857 1840 1857 1799 1868 1771 1857 1769 1857 1767 1857 1765 1857 1762 1857 1747 1868 1713 1859 1710 1859 1708 1859 1706 1859 1704 1859 1689 1872 1598 1872 1570 1859 1567 1859 1565 1859 1483 1870 1396 1859 1394 1859 1392 1859 1390 1859 1373 1872 1206 1861 1204 1861 1147 1872 1041 1861 1039 1861 978 1874 701 1864 699 1864 697 1864 675 1872 677 1907"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the natural condition of affairs before the arrival of the Russians, the increase"/>
